          "description": [
            "Annual undergraduate and graduate course catalogs of Virginia Polytechnic University: including campus maps; facility descriptions; lists of courses, schedules, students, and faculty; and other information relating to the operations of the institution. Virginia Polytechnic Institute published its annual catalog as an issue of the Bulletin of the Virginia Polytechnic Institute from April 1908 - October 1989 inclusive. The University Libraries at Virginia Tech recognizes that some issues of the Virginia Tech Course Catalogs contain offensive content that does not reflect the University\u2019s <a href=\"https://www.inclusive.vt.edu/Programs/vtpoc0.html\" target=\"_blank\">\u201cPrinciples of Community\u201d</a> and its commitment to inclusion and diversity. The University Libraries present the following content in its original and unaltered form for the purpose of research, study, and personal reading. Providing online access to these historical records does not endorse any attitudes, prejudices, or behaviors depicted in the pages of the Virginia Tech Course Catalogs. The University Libraries is committed to upholding the principle of equal and free access to unaltered historical information and supports the<a href=\"https://vtx.vt.edu/campus-news/statements/unirel-statement-040919.html\" target=\"_blank\"> University\u2019s statement on offensive photographs.</a>"
